L,37,'','','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,NULL,10,'','','A:  通过引荐潜在客户，推荐大使可获得订单金额 10% 的返佣',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','',0,0,1596189571,1596189571,1596189571,10,NULL),(34,'推荐成功后我能获得多少奖励？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,37,'','','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,1,10,'','','A:  通过引荐潜在客户，推荐大使可获得订单金额 10% 的返佣',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','',1,0,1596189572,1596189572,1596189572,10,NULL),(35,'设置业务模板和数据字典？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,38,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,1,10,'','','',NULL,NULL,'<p>1、设置——常用设置——公海池规则中，调整客户掉落公海池的规则，设定好在什么条件下客户回退公海池，避免客户资源浪费。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/statics/home/images/m3wd_img1.jpg\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2、在设置——常用设置——公海分组中，对掉落会公海的客户进行分组，方便筛选查看。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/statics/home/images/m3wd_img2.jpg\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','',0,0,1596190125,1596190125,1596190164,10,NULL),(36,'添加自定义角色？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,39,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,10,'','','',NULL,NULL,'<p>设置——常用设置——角色管理中，点击左侧新增角色，在功能权限区授权对应功能，数据权限区授权员工看见数据范围</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.xbongbong.com/Uploads/image/20200814/1597396775379833.png\"/>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','',1,0,1596190193,1596190193,1597396777,10,NULL),(37,'钉钉版怎么添加人员？',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,38,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,10,'','','',NULL,NULL,'<p>钉钉管理员进入钉钉管理后台https://oa.dingtalk.com/。</p><p>1、在通信录—组织架构中添加员工信息。并且调整员工所在部门。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.xbongbong.com/Uploads/image/20200814/1597396524768391.png\"/></p><p>2、选择工作台，找到销帮帮应用，点击设置，进入可见范围设置。将该员工加入可见范围。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.xbongbong.com/Uploads/image/20200814/1597396547961269.png\"/></p><p>3、由销帮帮管理员登录销帮帮，在员工管理，设置可见范围后并且同步钉钉组织架构即可。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.xbongbong.com/Uploads/image/20200814/1597396569320470.png\"/></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','',1,0